格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Token Bank — the local LLM gateway that sits between your AI agents and every provider. Know where tokens go · Spend less with smart routing to Ollama, Groq, GitHub Models · Earn by sharing idle quota on a community P2P network. One-click onboarding for Cursor, Claude Code, Codex","id":"gh:1233571420","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"tokenbank","slug":"wink-run/tokenbank","topics":["agent","anthropic","claudecode","codex","cursor","dsh","dsh-plugin","llm","llm-gateway","llm-gateway-system","llm-proxy","llm-router","local","local-first","observability","openai","openclaw","token","token-usage","tokenhub"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Token Bank — the local LLM gateway that sits between your AI agents and every provider. Know where t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"okens go · Spend less with smart routing to Ollama, Groq, GitHub Models · Earn by sharing idle quota"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" on a community P2P network. One-click onboarding for Cursor, Claude Code, Codex"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Token Bank"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> ## Your AI needs a manager.\n>\n> **Personal AI hub · Your token manager.** One local gateway for Cl"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"aude Code, Codex, Cursor, WorkBuddy, Kimi Code and more — see every token, spend less, keep every AI"},{"id":"p3s3","text":" asset in one place, orchestrate agents, and rent out what sits idle.\n>\n> Open source · Keep your wo"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"rkflow · One-click revert"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Website · Free download · ▶ Watch on YouTube · 中文文档 · Architecture · Privacy Policy"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Token Bank is a next-generation personal AI resource hub** that enables one-click onboarding and i"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ntelligent orchestration of mainstream AI tools like Claude, Cursor, Codex, and WorkBuddy through a "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"local gateway architecture."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### Core Value Proposition"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Usage Transparency**: Full-chain trace makes every token consumption accountable\n- **Cost Optimi"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"zation**: Smart routing automatically switches between local models, free quotas, paid subscriptions"},{"id":"p8s3","text":", and community-shared compute with lossless protocol adaptation\n- **Sharing Economy**: P2P compute-"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"sharing network creates a decentralized exchange for models and agents, monetizing idle resources in"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"twork creates a decentralized exchange for models and agents, monetizing idle resources into credits"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Technical Highlights"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Zero-Intrusion Integration**\nDeclarative application handlers (CLI env injection + config hot-patc"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"hing) enable seamless onboarding without modifying agent applications."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Multi-Protocol Adaptation Layer**\nTransparent protocol conversion (Anthropic Messages, OpenAI Chat"},{"id":"p11s2","text":", Codex Responses) allows agents to use third-party models without awareness."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Unified Asset Layer Architecture**\nCommunity agents run directly on users' existing agent applicat"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ions (Codex, Claude, Cursor, etc.) without rebuilding harnesses, executing within user-accumulated M"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"CP/Skill/Prompt assets for dual reuse of runtimes and tool ecosystems."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Scenario Routing Engine**\n- Routing policy learning from usage patterns\n- Lossless context compres"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"sion\n- Vision enhancement layer for non-multimodal models (automatic image recognition injection)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**MCP Built-in Relay & Resource Projection Gating**\nConstructs personal knowledge and tool ecosystem"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"s with controlled resource deployment."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**AI-Native Architecture**\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Why Token Bank"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Six AI headaches. One hub.**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Sound familiar? | What Token Bank does |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| **Too many AI tools** — each configured differently, switched by hand | **One-click onboarding**: "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"every tool behind one local address; revert to the official config anytime |\n| **Bills keep growing*"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"* — no idea where the tokens went | **Full-chain trace**: app, model, tokens and cost for every call"},{"id":"p19s4","text":", merged across devices |\n| **Quota expires unused** — free tiers idle while paid usage climbs | **S"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"mart routing**: local and free sources first, native model names unchanged, protocols converted auto"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"matically |\n| **Skills & MCPs everywhere** — copy-pasted, out of sync | **AI assets in one place**: "},{"id":"p19s7","text":"MCP / Skill / Prompt / Agent in one library, projected to the agents that need them |\n| **Top models"},{"id":"p19s8","text":" out of reach** — rare models and expert agents feel unreachable | **Sharing market**: pay per call "},{"id":"p19s9","text":"in credits to use rare models or hire expert agents |\n| **Idle capacity wasted** — unused subscripti"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"ons, local models gathering dust | **Earn from idle**: rent out models and agents for credits — API "},{"id":"p19s11","text":"keys, Skills and configs never leave your machine |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**Token Bank is your personal AI hub — your AI's manager.** Plug Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, WorkBud"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"dy, Kimi Code and more into one local gateway without changing how you work: **see clearly, spend le"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ss, stay simple**, keep your AI assets in order and let them **get smarter with you**, orchestrate a"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" team of agents from one sentence, and **earn from idle** by renting out what you don't use."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Five pillars:**"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Pillar | What you get |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| **See clearly** | One-click onboard; full trace; multi-device analytics; subscriptions vs PAYG sid"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"e by side |\n| **Spend less** | Seamless model swap; smart local-first + task-type routing; scene str"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ategies; optional lossless compression |\n| **Stay simple** | One-click onboard/restore; all AI asset"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"s in one library, projected to every agent; multi-account CLI by directory; tray status; one local a"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"ddress |\n| **Get smarter with you** | Work portrait; personalized MCP / Skill / Prompt / Agent disco"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"ver · accumulate · iterate |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Implementation notes:**"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Layer | What it does |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| **App handlers** | Declarative `app-handlers.yaml` for CLI shim / config-file patch / session scan"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"; WorkBuddy, Trae, Hermes, Kimi use strong install signals |\n| **Routing** | Unified “route = select"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"or chain”: personal/community/free/paid filters + task-type presets (`design` / `repo-qa` / `chore` "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"/ `debug`) |\n| **Resource projection** | Skill / Prompt / MCP only onto **hosted and installed** tar"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"gets; apps without stdio use the built-in MCP relay |\n| **Telemetry** | Live gateway logs + local se"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"ssion import (Claude / Codex / Cursor / WorkBuddy Trace, …) with auto-dedupe |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Core capabilities: one-click onboarding · seamless model swap · full trace"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Token Bank is more than an API proxy — it brings **Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, WorkBuddy, Kimi Code,"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" OpenClaw**, and other mainstream agents under one local gateway. **No agent-side changes required**"},{"id":"p30s3","text":" for usage tracing, third-party model switching, and smart routing."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## What's in the UI"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Connecting any OpenAI-compatible client"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"> Prefer **Gateway → Track** for one-click onboarding — no manual env vars. Pick a route and the age"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"nt keeps its native model names while the gateway transparently forwards to your chosen provider. Th"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"e app settings panel also lists bound resources and MCP for tryout."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
